{{!
    @template local_delegateaccount/dialog/confirm

    The body of the question asked before a destructive action: the danger tile, what is lost and what is kept, and the
    place of the error if the action fails.

    @copyright  2026 Didactika.org
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Example context (json):
    {
        "text": "Access ends at once, also in a session that is open now. The history and the activity are kept."
    }
}}
<div class="d-flex align-items-start">
    <span class="dd-tile dd-tile-danger mr-3 me-3">{{#pix}}t/delete, core{{/pix}}</span>
    <p class="mb-0">{{text}}</p>
</div>
<div class="alert alert-danger mt-3 mb-0" role="alert" data-region="confirm-error" hidden></div>
